@startuml
!include ../../../../images/common-sequence.iuml

title MQTT — Diagnostic Sensors & Certificate Fingerprint

box "On-Premises" $OnPrem
    participant "Client" as client
    participant "MQTT Broker" as mqtt
    participant "Home Assistant" as ha
end box

== Auto Discovery ==

client -> mqtt : **Publish Auto Discovery** retained\nhomeassistant/sensor/FireFly-{UUID}-ip-address/config\n""JSON payload""
mqtt -> ha : **Publish Auto Discovery**\nhomeassistant/sensor/FireFly-{UUID}-ip-address/config

client -> mqtt : **Publish Auto Discovery** retained\nhomeassistant/sensor/FireFly-{UUID}-mac-address/config\n""JSON payload""
mqtt -> ha : **Publish Auto Discovery**\nhomeassistant/sensor/FireFly-{UUID}-mac-address/config

client -> mqtt : **Publish Auto Discovery** retained\nhomeassistant/sensor/FireFly-{UUID}-time-start/config\n""JSON payload""
mqtt -> ha : **Publish Auto Discovery**\nhomeassistant/sensor/FireFly-{UUID}-time-start/config

client -> mqtt : **Publish Auto Discovery** retained\nhomeassistant/sensor/FireFly-{UUID}-count-errors/config\n""JSON payload""
mqtt -> ha : **Publish Auto Discovery**\nhomeassistant/sensor/FireFly-{UUID}-count-errors/config

client -> mqtt : **Publish Auto Discovery** retained\nhomeassistant/sensor/FireFly-{UUID}-cert/config\n""JSON payload""
mqtt -> ha : **Publish Auto Discovery**\nhomeassistant/sensor/FireFly-{UUID}-cert/config

ha -> ha : **Create diagnostic sensors**\n(initially Unavailable)

== Telemetry Publish ==

client -> mqtt : **Publish IP address** retained\nFireFly/{UUID}/ip-address/state\n""<ip>""\nretained
mqtt -> ha : **Publish IP address**\nFireFly/{UUID}/ip-address/state

client -> mqtt : **Publish MAC address** retained\nFireFly/{UUID}/mac-address/state\n""<mac>""\nretained
mqtt -> ha : **Publish MAC address**\nFireFly/{UUID}/mac-address/state

client -> mqtt : **Publish error count** retained\nFireFly/{UUID}/count-errors/state\n""<count>""\nretained
mqtt -> ha : **Publish error count**\nFireFly/{UUID}/count-errors/state

client -> mqtt : **Publish boot time** retained\nFireFly/{UUID}/time-start/state\n""<epoch>""\nretained
mqtt -> ha : **Publish boot time**\nFireFly/{UUID}/time-start/state

client -> mqtt : **Publish certificate fingerprint** retained\nFireFly/{UUID}/cert/state\n""<fingerprint>""\nretained
mqtt -> ha : **Publish certificate fingerprint**\nFireFly/{UUID}/cert/state

ha -> ha : **Set diagnostic sensors**\ncurrent values

== Error Count Change ==

client -> client : **Error log size changed**
client -> mqtt : **Publish error count** retained\nFireFly/{UUID}/count-errors/state\n""<count>""\nretained
mqtt -> ha : **Publish error count**\nFireFly/{UUID}/count-errors/state
ha -> ha : **Set Error Count**\nnew value

== Certificate Rotation ==

note over client, ha : On cert rotation broadcast, client updates cert and re-publishes fingerprint
client -> mqtt : **Publish certificate fingerprint** retained\nFireFly/{UUID}/cert/state\n""<new fingerprint>""\nretained
mqtt -> ha : **Publish certificate fingerprint**\nFireFly/{UUID}/cert/state
ha -> ha : **Set Certificate Fingerprint**\nnew value

@enduml
